<section class="admin-section" data-section="themes" aria-labelledby="themes-heading">
  <h1 id="themes-heading">Themes</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">Themes are validated before they can be activated: a theme that fails validation cannot become active. The active theme applies to pages rendered after activation.</p>

  <div id="th-status" class="flash flash-info" role="status" hidden></div>

  <p class="page-intro" id="th-active">Loading active theme…</p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="data-table" aria-label="Themes">
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Description</th><th scope="col">Screenshot</th><th scope="col">Actions</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody id="th-list">
        <tr><td colspan="5">Loading themes…</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <p class="field-help">Disk themes live in the <code>themes/</code> directory next to the server binary: each theme ships a <code>theme.yaml</code> manifest and a <code>templates/</code> directory. The embedded <code>default</code> theme always exists as the fallback.</p>
</section>
<script src="/assets/js/admin-pages.js" defer></script>
